  "rules": [
    "448 base fields stay untouched; 64 extension fields are additive, 512 total.",
    "Being selected as a non-voluntary night-world cleaner and choosing to sign an angel deal are separate facts. Do not conflate.",
    "Non-protagonist angel traders are written with a concrete unmet need or life deficit; no automatic claim that every cleaner willingly trades.",
    "Protagonist is the only established exception to the desire-based deal motif; do not fabricate a wish, financial debt, trauma or bargain.",
    "Protagonist SAN: 0..100 display scale, initial/baseline/minimum=50, maximum=100, encounters do not reduce SAN, no negative effects or passive decay, valid monster kills increase SAN (exact gain not approved). Current SAN is runtime save state, not a fixed character-file property.",
    "These are writing and data-design rules, not evidence that game code already implements them. Mechanics require separate verified implementation.",
